# Deployment Guide

This project can be deployed to any Edge Runtime environment, with Cloudflare Workers being the primary target.

## Local Development

To run the project locally for development, use:

```
pnpm dev
```

This uses [wrangler](mdc:wrangler.toml) for local development.

## Cloudflare Workers Deployment

To deploy to Cloudflare Workers:

```
pnpm deploy
```

Or use the Deploy button in the [README.md](mdc:README.md).

## Environment Variables for Deployment

Make sure to set the necessary environment variables in your deployment environment based on which LLM providers you want to support. See [Environment Configuration](mdc:.cursor/rules/environment-config.mdc) for details.

## Configuration Files

- [wrangler.toml](mdc:wrangler.toml) - Configuration for Cloudflare Workers deployment
- [package.json](mdc:package.json) - NPM scripts for development and deployment

